      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dogpatch%2C_San_Francisco"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Since the 1990s, Dogpatch has shifted from a working‑class enclave to an upper‑middle‑class neighborhood.",
